00:16:27,321 --> 00:16:29,420
to get the vehicle onto plane and to move at the speed

287
00:16:29,421 --> 00:16:30,420
that we need it to go.

288
00:16:31,260 --> 00:16:35,060
A flap called a bow plane redirects the water at the

