00:17:00,061 --> 00:17:02,700
and they open up and they will close and create a complete

296
00:17:02,800 --> 00:17:04,300
flat-bottom boat.

297
00:17:04,400 --> 00:17:08,400
We have the transom on the top, which folds down.

298
00:17:08,500 --> 00:17:11,100
And it's just like adjusting the trim on a boat.

299
00:17:11,200 --> 00:17:13,500
It gives us our trim and angle to help get the vehicle up

300
00:17:13,600 --> 00:17:14,500
on the plane.

301
00:17:17,120 --> 00:17:19,220
Powering this amphibious monster

