328
00:18:43,840 --> 00:18:48,840
The first alligator came off the assembly line in July 1941.

329
00:18:48,841 --> 00:18:53,480
The Marines dubbed it the LVT, standing for landing vehicle,

330
00:18:53,580 --> 00:18:54,280
tracked.

331
00:18:54,281 --> 00:18:56,580
It displaces water, and the displacement

332
00:18:56,680 --> 00:18:59,680
is enhanced by pontoons on either side of the vehicle.

333
00:18:59,780 --> 00:19:02,080
And these pontoons are called sponsons.

334
00:19:02,180 --> 00:19:05,420
And the sponsons are essentially flotation devices.

335
00:19:05,520 --> 00:19:09,200
And wrapped around the sponson is a large bicycle chain

336
00:19:09,300 --> 00:19:13,500
