339
00:19:19,661 --> 00:19:22,600
These cleats are designed almost like a paddle wheel,

340
00:19:22,601 --> 00:19:25,160
but where they are churning through the water

341
00:19:25,161 --> 00:19:28,840
and literally pulling the vehicle through the water.

342
00:19:28,841 --> 00:19:30,800
The cleats could slog the alligator forward

343
00:19:30,801 --> 00:19:35,120
