345
00:19:38,641 --> 00:19:40,640
The tracks on which the cleats were mounted

346
00:19:40,641 --> 00:19:45,160
propelled the vehicle on land at 20 miles per hour, almost as fast

347
00:19:45,161 --> 00:19:47,500
