348
00:19:47,600 --> 00:19:49,860
They worked effectively on soft beaches,

349
00:19:49,960 --> 00:19:54,060
but wore down quickly on harder surfaces.

350
00:19:54,160 --> 00:19:57,700
Despite its limitations, the LVT proved its value quickly

351
00:19:57,800 --> 00:20:01,600
at the Battle of Tarawa in 1943.

352
00:20:01,700 --> 00:20:05,820
As they came up to the reef that fronted the landing beaches,

353
00:20:05,920 --> 00:20:08,120
the Japanese had never seen boats with wheels,

354
00:20:08,220 --> 00:20:09,620
as they dubbed them.

355
00:20:09,720 --> 00:20:13,020
And so they weren't really sure whether they should take them

356
00:20:13,120 --> 00:20:14,320
under fire when they hit the reef,

357
00:20:14,321 --> 00:20:17,220
because they assumed that they would bottom out on the reef.

358
00:20:17,320 --> 00:20:19,560
Much to their dismay, the boats with wheels

359
00:20:19,660 --> 00:20:21,960
churned over the reef.

360
00:20:22,060 --> 00:20:24,460
At Tarawa and throughout the Pacific,

361
00:20:24,560 --> 00:20:27,100
the alligators helped the Americans prevail,

362
00:20:27,200 --> 00:20:29,200
as they effectively ferried men and supplies

363
00:20:29,300 --> 00:20:31,980
over treacherous coral reefs and onto the beaches.

364
00:20:36,380 --> 00:20:38,920
But military planners opted not to use the alligators

365
00:20:39,020 --> 00:20:42,020
