00:21:46,620 --> 00:21:47,720
from the suspension.

382
00:21:47,820 --> 00:21:50,020
The enemy has the capability of thermal imagery.

383
00:21:50,120 --> 00:21:52,660
At night, this vehicle will give out quite a big heat

384
00:21:52,760 --> 00:21:54,140
signature, as large as it is.

385
00:21:54,240 --> 00:21:56,900
This helps dissipate the heat away from the suspension

386
00:21:57,000 --> 00:21:59,840
to give it a smaller signature using a thermal viewer.

387
00:21:59,940 --> 00:22:02,380
It's a plastic material, and all it does is it just waves

388
00:22:02,480 --> 00:22:05,040
in the wind and helps to dissipate the heat.

389
00:22:05,041 --> 00:22:07,040
heat.

390
00:22:07,140 --> 00:22:08,580
The expeditionary fighting vehicle

391
00:22:08,680 --> 00:22:11,480
may wear a skirt, but there's nothing girlish

392
00:22:11,580 --> 00:22:12,480
about its firepower.

393
00:22:14,880 --> 00:22:17,480
The vehicle's fully stabilized, has second generation forward

394
00:22:17,580 --> 00:22:21,480
looking infrared, 30 millimeter cannon, and a 7.62 coax.

395
00:22:21,580 --> 00:22:24,100
And that Marine no longer has to gauge the wind.

396
00:22:24,200 --> 00:22:26,800
He can just essentially put his crosshairs on a target

397
00:22:26,900 --> 00:22:29,600
