398
00:22:29,700 --> 00:22:32,100
Between the 30 millimeter and the 7.62,

399
00:22:32,101 --> 00:22:36,100
to allow the gunner to basically pick and choose

400
00:22:36,101 --> 00:22:37,380
what targets he wants to destroy

401
00:22:37,381 --> 00:22:38,780
and apply the appropriate firepower.

402
00:22:41,980 --> 00:22:43,740
This expeditionary fighting vehicle

403
00:22:43,741 --> 00:22:46,540
