463
00:26:24,260 --> 00:26:28,780
and speed. It does take a lot of skill.

464
00:26:28,880 --> 00:26:31,280
It takes a lot of coordination between the two pilots as well

465
00:26:31,380 --> 00:26:34,380
as the boom operator to make sure that we do the mission

466
00:26:34,480 --> 00:26:38,420
safely. Computers play a big role

467
00:26:38,421 --> 00:26:42,860
in this demanding procedure, especially the autopilot.

468
00:26:42,960 --> 00:26:45,120
It keeps the jet relatively stable

469
00:26:45,220 --> 00:26:46,560
