476
00:26:59,280 --> 00:27:01,740
It's critical that the pilots keep in touch with the boom

477
00:27:01,840 --> 00:27:04,680
operator to let him know where the aircraft's approaching from

478
00:27:04,780 --> 00:27:05,680
