00:37:20,180 --> 00:37:25,080
caravans of trucks, billions of pounds of supplies,

663
00:37:25,081 --> 00:37:25,781
supplies.

664
00:37:29,480 --> 00:37:33,180
When America wages war, all of these crucial assets

