688
00:38:49,401 --> 00:38:53,040
The main ramp that we offload cargo with is the stern ramp.

689
00:38:53,140 --> 00:38:55,400
That's the preferred method of offloading the ship.

690
00:38:55,500 --> 00:38:58,180
It's a huge ramp that goes down on the stern

691
00:38:58,280 --> 00:38:59,840
and lands on the pier.

692
00:38:59,940 --> 00:39:02,420
And it's basically just a ramp for vehicles

693
00:39:02,520 --> 00:39:04,280
to drive up and down.

694
00:39:04,380 --> 00:39:09,260
It's the most flexible way to onload and offload the vessel.

695
00:39:09,360 --> 00:39:12,020
We also have a side port ramp, which

696
00:39:12,120 --> 00:39:14,060
